flowchart TB
  accTitle: The entity resolution pipeline
  accDescr: Candidate pairs come from several blocking sources and get evidence and a rule score; an LLM judge gives its verdict in the grey zone, and constrained clustering with the owner's labels builds the villas.
  listings[("Listings and photos")]:::store --> blocking["Blocking<br/>four candidate sources"]
  blocking --> evidence["Pair evidence<br/>photos, location, structure, price"]
  evidence --> score["Transparent rule score<br/>sum of named contributions"]
  score --> policy{"Decision policy<br/>config/er.toml"}:::decision
  judge["LLM judge<br/>photo grid + facts"]:::llm --> policy
  policy --> merges["Machine merges"]:::good
  policy --> queue["Human queue<br/>er-human"]:::human
  labels["Owner's labels<br/>must-link and cannot-link"]:::human --> cluster
  merges --> cluster["Greedy clustering<br/>at most one per platform"]
  queue -.-> labels
  cluster --> reconcile["Id reconciliation<br/>with the previous run"]
  reconcile --> villas[("er.villa and history")]:::store
